(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\nEN: 10k to +3V3 and 1 uF to GND, from the module datasheet RC-delay recommendation.\\nGPIO0: 10k pull-up, button to GND, normal SPI boot. GPIO46 and GPIO45 are left open (internal pull-down). Do not pull GPIO45 high.\\nGPIO3: 10k to GND. Datasheet: no internal pull, level must be defined. Default eFuse ignores GPIO3 for JTAG source.\\nUSB VBUS is not connected to +5V or +3V3. A cable that also carries 12 V battery power does not backfeed the onboard 5 V rail, and the onboard 5 V rail does not drive VBUS.\\nCC1 and CC2 each have 5.1k to GND, the device-side Rd. D+ and D- each have 22 ohm series resistors on the module side of U_ESD. There is no VBUS-detect GPIO." (at 20 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "f6848dc0-1782-4472-b225-c16e84458e3e"))
