(text "CC 5.1k is USB Type-C Rd for a device port. 22 ohm series resistors are preliminary full-speed series values, not a safety rating.\\nU_ESD is USBLC6-2SC6, SOT-23-6. Both I/O1 pins are USB_DP_C and both I/O2 pins are USB_DN_C, on the connector side of R17 and R18.\\nIts VBUS pin is USB_VBUS. That net is not +5V and not +3V3. The device does not source VBUS and does not present Rp.\\nShield is 1M || 100nF to board GND, not a hard chassis bond. Chassis bond is OPEN.\\n10 uF + 100 nF at the module 3V3 pin follows the Espressif guidance to put bulk capacitance at the module power pin.\\nGPIO1 is WDI_FUTURE. The relay sheet uses it as the heartbeat. This sheet does not toggle it, and the prototype firmware is not modified." (at 20 80 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "31b4e845-c7b3-4ded-9405-ac10e205af6e"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
